{{Velious Era}}
A large tower located in the Wakening Lands. Skyshrine is the home of Lord Yelinak, the Dragon who controls the zone, keeping the Giants from getting to the Western Wastes.

This is a massive tower which can be entered through the Wakening Land or a portal in Cobalt Scar. With winding stairs, twisting caves, and a maze among numerous wurms, wyverns, and drakes, navigation can be tricky. Unless you are an ally of the Claws of Veeshan, you are best off avoiding the city of Skyshrine.

