== Dangers ==

It is possible that some monsters in this zone can see invis. You are unable to Summon Corpses from anywhere but right near the entrance. A large section of the zone is a maze where you must proceed carefully because there are many spinning traps as well as teleports that will keep you trapped for quite some time unless you learn your way around it.

== Benefits ==

There are many quests that can be done in this dungeon if your faction with the inhabitants is high enough. Also, there are many spells that drop or can be found in this zone. Melees can be bound in this zone in certain areas, notably the courtyard leading to Cobalt Scar.

== Traveling To and From Skyshrine ==

Skyshrine is located at 1450, 4500 in the [[Wakening Land]].

Cobalt Scar can be reached from here by clicking on a statue. You require the [[Shrine Key]] that can be obtained either through a quest from [[Ziglark Whisperwing]] or simply by killing him, depending on your Dragon faction.

You can also group with somebody who has the [[Shrine Key]]. When they click on the firepot with their key then their whole group will be zoned to [[Cobalt Scar]]. If you're a wizard or druid then this is a convenient way to skip needing the key to get your CS tooth, though a much easier way is to get a wizard to translocate you to Cobalt Scar as this doesn't require a key.

In the first room of the first level of the tower there is an open book on a pedestal. Clicking the book will teleport you to the courtyard with the pool and the exit to Cobalt Scar, 425, -326.

In the room to the north of the armor quest mobs are two claws hanging from the wall, one holding a red orb and one holding a green orb. Clicking the red orb will teleport you to the first level of the tower, -60, 600. Clicking the green orb will teleport you to the courtyard with the pool and the exit to Cobalt Scar, 425, -326.

